{
 "engine": "kokoro",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "before": 0.4,
 "between": 0.35,
 "after": 0.6,
 "voices": [
  {
   "id": "af_heart",
   "label": "Heart",
   "scenes": [
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "Start with what Silo saw itself.",
       "file": "voice/7f316c8bcf64e523.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 1.586
      },
      {
       "text": "An agent opens a connection.",
       "file": "voice/3599219fc941255a.mp3",
       "start": 2.336,
       "length": 1.625
      },
      {
       "text": "It passes through a part of Silo that sits outside the computer.",
       "file": "voice/057496a1e9e2e577.mp3",
       "start": 4.311,
       "length": 3.403
      },
      {
       "text": "The agent also writes a file.",
       "file": "voice/718d7fcd9f9ce968.mp3",
       "start": 8.064,
       "length": 1.693
      },
      {
       "text": "The file stays inside, and Silo sees the change from outside, on the computer's disk.",
       "file": "voice/bb91a91367601c77.mp3",
       "start": 10.107,
       "length": 5.081
      },
      {
       "text": "Silo writes one line for each: a fact.",
       "file": "voice/5da19611a0b02f22.mp3",
       "start": 15.538,
       "length": 2.35
      },
      {
       "text": "It is never changed.",
       "file": "voice/29dc2ebcecf6a5c0.mp3",
       "start": 18.238,
       "length": 1.129
      }
     ],
     "total": 19.967
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "Some things cannot be seen from outside, such as which process wrote that file.",
       "file": "voice/0d8b30cbb16f402f.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 4.251
      },
      {
       "text": "A process is one running program.",
       "file": "voice/67e5908ea2288b10.mp3",
       "start": 5.001,
       "length": 1.99
      },
      {
       "text": "A small part of Silo, the probe, runs inside the computer and tells Silo.",
       "file": "voice/0224594135a48fd8.mp3",
       "start": 7.341,
       "length": 4.23
      },
      {
       "text": "That line is a report.",
       "file": "voice/ff1a3b04fd9b6ff0.mp3",
       "start": 11.921,
       "length": 1.288
      },
      {
       "text": "The agent has full access in there, so a report is only what the inside said.",
       "file": "voice/2acac042efa6bbb0.mp3",
       "start": 13.559,
       "length": 4.367
      },
      {
       "text": "An agent program, such as Claude Code, can also give its own account of itself.",
       "file": "voice/f2e3cb9c828731bd.mp3",
       "start": 18.276,
       "length": 4.64
      },
      {
       "text": "That is a report too.",
       "file": "voice/028fbf04ecd021b6.mp3",
       "start": 23.266,
       "length": 1.236
      }
     ],
     "total": 25.102
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "Facts and reports, in the order they came, are the record.",
       "file": "voice/ab7f87b907df0a30.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 2.971
      },
      {
       "text": "Nothing in it is changed afterwards.",
       "file": "voice/eaa6ea2bd6066a56.mp3",
       "start": 3.721,
       "length": 1.895
      },
      {
       "text": "One line is never both: that the file changed is a fact, and which process changed it is a report that points to it.",
       "file": "voice/4f100a2173af5401.mp3",
       "start": 5.966,
       "length": 6.593
      }
     ],
     "total": 13.159
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "An opinion is what something thinks about the record: this file is code, this agent is stuck.",
       "file": "voice/4255f453151fcc5e.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 5.236
      },
      {
       "text": "It is computed from the record, and kept apart from it.",
       "file": "voice/de6c34e56742ee37.mp3",
       "start": 5.986,
       "length": 2.882
      },
      {
       "text": "It can be wrong.",
       "file": "voice/a85c7a6629fa4dfd.mp3",
       "start": 9.218,
       "length": 0.888
      },
      {
       "text": "So it says whose it is, and when what gave it improves, its opinions are computed again.",
       "file": "voice/726abd4961d6a79a.mp3",
       "start": 10.456,
       "length": 4.977
      },
      {
       "text": "The rows of the record do not change.",
       "file": "voice/94c46af019074414.mp3",
       "start": 15.783,
       "length": 1.864
      },
      {
       "text": "You can give one too.",
       "file": "voice/81c4e0005c132273.mp3",
       "start": 17.997,
       "length": 1.154
      },
      {
       "text": "Silo asks: is this a build?",
       "file": "voice/8af8eeccdb3403f8.mp3",
       "start": 19.501,
       "length": 1.825
      },
      {
       "text": "Your answer is your opinion.",
       "file": "voice/d6522d8591ad354b.mp3",
       "start": 21.676,
       "length": 1.463
      },
      {
       "text": "Silo keeps it as you gave it.",
       "file": "voice/7c276e5ef2c3ca1f.mp3",
       "start": 23.489,
       "length": 1.546
      }
     ],
     "total": 25.635
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "What gives an opinion is called a classifier: a pattern, a function, a small model, or an agent.",
       "file": "voice/be08fa9925e148b2.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 5.838
      },
      {
       "text": "A classifier gives opinions.",
       "file": "voice/e1700bf34eb21fda.mp3",
       "start": 6.588,
       "length": 1.654
      },
      {
       "text": "It never acts.",
       "file": "voice/2f8b7321272783d2.mp3",
       "start": 8.592,
       "length": 0.962
      },
      {
       "text": "What an opinion can lead to comes in the film on rules and precautions.",
       "file": "voice/25ddc055527cb75c.mp3",
       "start": 9.904,
       "length": 3.674
      }
     ],
     "total": 14.178
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "Something computed is as sure as its least sure ingredient.",
       "file": "voice/825a027915ebed94.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 3.225
      },
      {
       "text": "A count of facts is as good as a fact.",
       "file": "voice/3e4f9d7aff90e196.mp3",
       "start": 3.975,
       "length": 1.919
      },
      {
       "text": "Mix in a report, and the result is as told: no surer than the report.",
       "file": "voice/ede98562a06b7cef.mp3",
       "start": 6.244,
       "length": 4.357
      },
      {
       "text": "Add a judgement, and it is an opinion.",
       "file": "voice/8c8cd4e920a8d07d.mp3",
       "start": 10.951,
       "length": 2.01
      },
      {
       "text": "And a report or an opinion is never stored as a fact.",
       "file": "voice/b9ba08f3f74a7820.mp3",
       "start": 13.311,
       "length": 3.114
      }
     ],
     "total": 17.025
    },
    {
     "sentences": [
      {
       "text": "All the reports together account for 48 megabytes, written by the build.",
       "file": "voice/0ef522359cb5ce39.mp3",
       "start": 0.4,
       "length": 4.13
      },
      {
       "text": "From outside, Silo saw 61 megabytes change.",
       "file": "voice/d6265e3fc0d6ce8a.mp3",
       "start": 4.88,
       "length": 3.101
      },
      {
       "text": "Silo corrects neither.",
       "file": "voice/f403567a4c9b7d52.mp3",
       "start": 8.331,
       "length": 1.232
      },
      {
       "text": "The 13 megabytes left over are shown as unattributed, and are never spread over the rest.",
       "file": "voice/ef3acfcf6a21b227.mp3",
       "start": 9.913,
       "length": 5.416
      },
      {
       "text": "And where Silo lost sight for a moment, it records a gap.",
       "file": "voice/bd744073e1b5d5ec.mp3",
       "start": 15.679,
       "length": 2.96
      },
      {
       "text": "The record says what it does not know.",
       "file": "voice/1449b6b20556ab5c.mp3",
       "start": 18.989,
       "length": 1.726
      }
     ],
     "total": 21.315
    }
   ],
   "total": 136.381
  }
 ]
}
